From 69572cb4aa547a38501787e2e274658dea9c36ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:56:10 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Seto 21:20 notes: book-disabled control in
 r36-dtw-position (note a); drop the committed .pyc and ignore __pycache__
 (note c)

- tests/r36-dtw-position.test.mjs: (4) the Time Typhoon seat with the book switched off puts printed-0 Barian in
  Defence, so the Attack answer comes from P5 alone; another deck's answer is identical with the book on and off, and
  the book pick hook returns nothing there (replaces the loose "other decks untouched" check as the strict one).
- tools/__pycache__/cdb-to-card.cpython-313.pyc removed from the index; .gitignore gains __pycache__/.
No dist/ change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HYdavRJmQWYnZCPQsymeGW
